WEBVTT

00:06:27.413 --> 00:06:30.121
it's the one-size-fits-all approach.

00:06:31.204 --> 00:06:32.746
Outside of Eugene, Oregon,

00:06:32.788 --> 00:06:35.579
that man would have been placed
on a 72-hour hold.

00:06:35.871 --> 00:06:37.538
He could have been incarcerated,

00:06:37.538 --> 00:06:39.163
he might even have died.

00:06:39.871 --> 00:06:43.954
He would have been
under more financial stress and burden,

00:06:43.996 --> 00:06:46.246
and his mental health
would have been no better.

00:06:47.038 --> 00:06:48.746
Two million people

00:06:48.746 --> 00:06:51.913
are booked into jails
and prisons every year.

00:06:52.288 --> 00:06:55.371
And the National Alliance
for Mental Health,

00:06:55.371 --> 00:06:58.288
they've reported
that 83 percent of these folks

00:06:58.329 --> 00:07:00.246
don't have access to mental health care.